## 2. Methodology

- Data is split once by `split_dataset` (shared with training, seed {{ seed }}): {% if r.split_sizes.oot %}the latest applications by date form the out-of-time (OOT) sample, and the remaining data is split stratified into train and test.{% else %}stratified train/test split (no date column, so no OOT sample).{% endif %}

- Sample sizes: train {{ r.split_sizes.train | fmt }}, test {{ r.split_sizes.test | fmt }}, OOT {{ r.split_sizes.oot | fmt }}.
- Metrics use the **held-out test** sample (and OOT sample). The training sample is used
  only as the stability reference and for the WoE/IV review.
- Thresholds: PSI investigate {{ thresholds.psi_investigate }}, escalate {{ thresholds.psi_escalate }}; CSI investigate {{ thresholds.csi_investigate }}, escalate {{ thresholds.csi_escalate }}.

